From cf43cc8f635a0496446712249e89125098686adb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: seedds <seedds@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 16:24:45 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] 0192 wario: graft skinning matrices for the 4 arm-twist bones

Wario's body files have ArmL1Sub/ArmL2Sub/ArmR1Sub/ArmR2Sub by name
but smooth_mtx_idx = -1 (no skinning matrix), so the map
player-figure animation writes to a non-existent matrix slot and
the game stalls on the world map (log-70/log-72, no crash). Append
the 4 bone indices to mtx_to_bone_list at slots 20-23 with identity
inverse-bind matrices, set smooth_mtx_idx 20/21/22/23, bump
num_smooth_mtxs 20->24 (Gold/Waluigi 19->24, Head also grafted at
slot 19). WarioPilot untouched (control: it already has the matrices).
---
 dm/romfs-overlay/ObjectData/Wario.szs         | Bin 516512 -> 1284199 bytes
 .../ObjectData/WarioColorClassic.szs          | Bin 631596 -> 1108375 bytes
 .../ObjectData/WarioColorGold.szs             | Bin 2067060 -> 3329287 bytes
 .../ObjectData/WarioColorLuigi.szs            | Bin 631156 -> 1107799 bytes
 .../ObjectData/WarioColorWaluigi.szs          | Bin 619308 -> 1088323 bytes
 .../ObjectData/WarioColorWario.szs            | Bin 632132 -> 1106836 bytes
 dm/romfs-overlay/ObjectData/WarioHigh.szs     | Bin 1620900 -> 4129495 bytes
 .../ObjectData/WarioPrimitiveMan.szs          | Bin 89708 -> 209383 bytes
 8 files changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)

